== VERDICT ==
Same sign as HLCA but not significant (p = 0.529) on 21 units.
THIS TEST WAS NOT INFORMATIVE. Its 80%-power MDE is 0.361, larger than the HLCA effect it is meant to
evaluate (-0.1869). GSE136831 could not have detected an effect
of that size even if it were exactly true, so this is neither support nor
a failed replication -- it is an absent test. P1-20(a) is NOT resolved by
this dataset, and the claim stays a supplementary observation.

Either way: 1 Control / 6 COPD / 15 IPF is a disease-skewed donor set, and
no disease-stratified statement may be made from this file.

PANEL SHRINKAGE: tgfb_ieg lost CCN1;CCN2.
A panel that lost genes is a different panel -- weigh the arm accordingly.

